      "statement": "BIGINT event-count outputs are acceptable wherever the contract declares HUGEINT, including the daily event counts in klaviyo__events.",
      "about": "requirement",
      "target": "marts.klaviyo__events.day_opened_email, day_clicked_email, day_placed_order, and day_ordered_product",
