      "alternative": "The contract describes first_event_on as \"Earliest activity date from person_metrics; NULL if missing\" and last_event_on as \"Latest activity date from person_metrics; NULL if missing\".",
      "importance": 2,
      "reason": "If the upstream dates differ, the published primary dates would disagree with the dates used to calculate retention.",
      "updates": null
    }
  ],
